{
  "id": "p09",
  "rule": "deleting posts and pages (DELETE /wp/v2/<base>/<id>): the delete_post check per caller before any trash check (contributor, anonymous, subscriber and author on another's post), the trash answered in the edit context with its links (slug __trashed, plain link and permalink template, the revision the trash saves), 410 on a trashed post with or without force=false, the trashed post read back and refused to the anonymous caller and to the contributor's delete, force answering deleted and the edit-context previous without links (a trashed post, a protected draft whatever the context asked, a published post with force=1), the editor's trash by method override and leaving the trash through PUT, a page on its route, a post under the pages route and a page under the posts route, and the missing and zero ids",
